+
+```text
+kprove spec.k --definition verification-kompiled --spec-module SPEC --smt-timeout 10000
+```
+
+Result: `#Top`, exit 0
+(`evidence/kprove-all-claims.log`).
+
+As a diagnostic, selecting only `SPEC.get-positive-correct` removes the loop
